---
description: Git collaboration and honest product boundaries for the shared repository
alwaysApply: true
---

This repository contains independent InfraPulse Python and Roadwatch pnpm/TypeScript projects. Read README.md and docs/collaboration.md before moving files across project boundaries. Do not connect their pipelines implicitly.
Work on a topic branch based on fetched github/main, preserve uncommitted edits, and open a PR for review. Never force-push or push directly to main; leave Replit's backup remote intact. Avoid committing .env files, local data, dependencies, datasets, model weights, and generated build files.
InfraPulse is screening, not structural certification. Roadwatch's mobile detection is illustrative; only NWS/USGS environmental context is live. Do not describe a real device ingest or road-condition inference from environmental data.